<title>USA: Technical Communications Q2 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Technical Communications Q2 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>CONCORD, Mass. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter Ended</p>
<p>					  Mar 29, 1997     Mar 30, 1996</p>
<p> Net sales				$4,054,348	 $3,695,727</p>
<p> Net earnings				121,924	    314,065</p>
<p> Earnings per share			    .09		  .25</p>
<p>						  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					  Mar 29, 1997     Mar 30, 1996</p>
<p> Net sales				 7,112,462	  5,836,567</p>
<p> Net earnings				157,875	     25,851</p>
<p> Earnings per share			    .12		  .02</p>
<p>NOTE:  Technical Communications Corp said its second quarter period ended March 29.</p>
</text>
